window.products.push({"id":579004,"name":"Gaming Chair Ergonomic Office Desk Chair Flip-up Armrest and Height Adjustable Seat Home Work Computer Chair Splicing PU Leather with Lumbar Back Supp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6164hH7qvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏷【Premium Desk Chair Quality】 Premium PU leather with a soft foam cushion is very comfortable. The black gloss on the wheelbase and handles, and the finish and textures on the leather material make it look very premium. The base is pretty wide gives you plenty of extra room. The 360° Nylon wheels are smooth and gliding from one end of the room to another is a breeze, providing freedom of movement and the convenience of communicating with others, and the chair wheels won't scratch your floors. 🏷【Ergonomic Design】 The back of this ergonomic office chair is designed to be curved to ideally fit your spine and reduce back tiredness. And the backrest provides great lumbar support for long periods of sitting. The desk chair can be adjusted according to your height, offer a tilt, and rocking mode give you more relaxation. 🏷【Adjustable Height】 The flip-up armrest chair fits up with a gas-lifting mechanism. You can smoothly adjust its height by pushing the control bar located under the seat. The chair is pivoting armrests which are very well padded too. The office chair is height and tilts adjustable so you can customize the position to your comfort which is great. 🏷【Sturdy and Durable】Our modern homework chairs with flip-up arms offer a heavy-duty durable nylon base, safety gas lift and rolling casters, supporting adults up to 250 pounds. High-back office chairs match with other high-quality office accessories and strictly meet BIFMA Standard to maximally ensure your safety. 🏷【Easy Assembly】 This computer game chair comes with all the screws and tools and is easy to assemble as it only takes 15 minutes to put the whole thing together. Let this gaming chair become your back pain-free experience when sitting by the writing desk, office desk, computer desk, L-shaped desk, study desk, corner desk, pc desk, gaming desk, etc. It will make your space more modern and elegant. 🏷【Routine maintenance】 Every 6 months, please check all bolts and screws to ensure they are tight. To clean, spot cleans only using a damp towel and mild cleaner, first test on a small, obscure area of fabric. We offer our customers a 12-month warranty and 100% contentment assurance for this video gaming chair. 🏷【Package Size】33.46 x 12.6 x 25.59 inches. 🏷【Package Weight】40.79 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6164hH7qvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUNMOS","source_asin":"B09H72PR88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H72PR88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H72PR88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
