window.products.push({"id":579007,"name":"MIRPLUS 36 X 24 inch Medicine Cabinet with Mirror-Lights Surface Mount Bathroom Mirror Cabinet Wall Mounted Lighted Bathroom Medicine Cabinets Inducti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":369.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W7WC671WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"·[Inductive Switch Control]: This led mirror medicine cabinet uses a unique hand sliding sensor switch design, which means that the led mirror can be easily opened or closed without touching the mirror. When your hands are stained with water or other stains, compared with the LED mirror medicine cabinet with a touch switch, you can turn on the LED mirror more conveniently and without leaving water or stains on the mirror. You don’t need to frequently Scrub the mirror. ·[Waterproof & Safer]: This bathroom medicine cabinet has a waterproof and moisture-proof design, have been certified by ETL listed,IP44 rated to ensure safe lighting in wet bathroom environments. It is very suitable for bathroom decoration lighting and makeup. ·[2-IN-1 Multipurpose]: The 2-layer medicine cabinet can not only be used as a storage assistant, but also as a makeup mirror. The internal adjustable space is very suitable for placing medicines, cosmetics, shaving tools, towels, soap, shampoo, shower gel, etc. in the bathroom, dressing room or cloakroom, etc. ·[High Quality]:This Double door bathroom mirror cabinet is made of high-grade aluminum alloy, with a rust-free and debris-free appearance, which protects the cabinet from moisture and water, and is safer in humid environments.The LED lamp lifetime: 50,000 hours (Using the LED mirror 5 hours a day means it will last 27 Years). ·[Packaging & Accessories]: This wall-mounted medicine cabinet comes with customized packaging to better protect the LED mirror and cabinet. It has passed all tests, including drop test, impact test, stress test, etc.100cm Hard wire no plugs, 2-layer tempered glass partition，screws, positioning plates, wall brackets and installation instructions included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W7WC671WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIRPLUS","source_asin":"B09VGNFGJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VGNFGJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VGNFGJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579008,"name":"Cardiff Wales Skyline Blue by Michael Tompsett, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FjcOHsxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a watercolor skyline of Cardiff, Wales. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FjcOHsxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01MRZT27R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRZT27R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRZT27R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
