window.products.push({"id":579079,"name":"Beichi Flameless Battery Operated Candles Set of 6(D2.2 x H 5\" 5\" 6\" 6\" 7\" 8\"), Ivory Real Wax Pillar LED Candles with Remote Timer, Amber Yellow Flic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WTFkt7XuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6 X Flameless Pillar Candles with Timer + 1 X 10 Keys Remote Control + Immediate Assistance from BEICHI Customer Service Team Replace Traditional Burning Candles： BEICHI 6 elegant pillar LED candles that offer a beautiful ambient to your dining room, bedroom or even bathroom, without posing the common threats that a real flamed candle does. MULTI-FUNCTION REMOTE CONTROL ♥ON/OFF Button: Illuminating the Candle through ON/OFF (Note:Before you use the Remote Control, switch the ON/OFF button to \"ON\" at the bottom of the LED fake candles) ♥Timer: When the candle light is on, press \"2H/4H/6H/8H\" to set the candle \"burning\" time for 2/4/6/8 hours. The timer will cycle every 24 hours ♥Mode: Press \"Candle\" to get flickering light; Press \"Light\" to get steady light  ♥Brightness Control: Press \"-\" to lower the brightness, \"+\" to increase brightness PRODUCT DETAILS: Material: Paraffin wax Smart Operation: 10-Keys remote control Remote Control Range: 5 meters (16.4 ft) Battery: 2 AA batteries per candle (not included) Light color: warm yellow. Candle Color: Ivory Finish: Smooth, Melted Edge Intended Use: Ambient Lighting / Home Decoration / Holiday Gift / Wedding / Festival Celebration WHAT'S IN THE BOX? 2 x Flameless Candles(Size: D 2.2\" x H 5\") 2 x Flameless Candles(Size: D 2.2\" x H 6\") 1 x Flameless Candles(Size: D 2.2\" x H 7\") 1 x Flameless Candle(Size: D 2.2\" x H 8\") 1 x 10-Key Remote Control  1 x User Manual MORE TIPS: 1. Keep out of direct sunlight, away from heat sources and out of extreme temperatures or your ivory wax candle may soften or melt. 2. One set of batteries lasts approx. 200 hours with typical use (depending on the quality of the batteries). 3. If you don't like thin candles, think twice，thanks.( This one diameter is 2.2\").","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WTFkt7XuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beichi","source_asin":"B07D8PJYJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D8PJYJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D8PJYJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
