window.products.push({"id":579245,"name":"Furinno Nightland 8-Inch Mattress, Queen, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q32gHtlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Furinno Nightland 8 mattress uses our highest quality, built-in-house pocketed coil system to offer maximum support and long lasting comfort. The individual pocketed coils move independently to contour precisely to each person for individualized comfort and pressure relief. They also do not transfer motion so you can have an undisturbed sleep even if your partner moves all night. To enhance comfort, the coils are covered by thick layers of foam and quality fabrics. To save you with cost of shipping, this mattress is vacuum packed and rolled for convenient delivery. You may sleep on your new Furinno mattress right after it is unpacked. However, We recommend you allow up to 48 hours for the mattress to fully expand to its proper shape and size. For your safety, this mattress meets Federal Flammability Standard CFR1633.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q32gHtlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furinno","source_asin":"B00NI1O4G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NI1O4G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NI1O4G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579246,"name":"Laundry Bag Backpack Extra Large - 115L Blue Travel Laundry Bags with Straps for Camp, Heavy Duty Laundry Bag, College Laundry Bag for Students, Dirty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T4jPm2OLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Laundry Bags Extra Large Heavy Duty】: Our 28''H X 15''L laundry bag contains 115L maximum capacity with multiple pockets. Moreover a fantastic expandable design on the top for expanding to 40'' height, 3-4 batches of laundry can be holded. It's made of tear-resistant 600D oxford fabric. Special reinforcement method keeps our waterproof cloth laundry bags from tearing. Ensure longer life and durable use. 【External Pocket and Zippered Pocket】: It's a laundry bag, meanwhile a perfect item organizer. The multi-pocket design keeps your items organized and easier to find. A large velcro pocket on the front provides extra storage space for laundry detergent or softener or shoes, and two zippered side pockets for your phone, cash, laundry cards, keys or small items etc. 【Humanized Ergonomic Design】: The laundry bag has a belt under it that distributes part of the weight of the shoulders to the waist, this ergonomic laundry bag can support the back to the maximum, prevent back and shoulder pain. In addition, it has padded, adjustable shoulder straps to fit a variety of people, so you can free up your hands for other tasks. We've also designed a drawstring closure on the mouth top, combined with the buckled straps, to help avoid spillage. 【Multi-Purpose Use】: The dirty clothes laundry bag is very suitable for a dorm or apartment where laundry needs to be transported. You can also use laundry backpack as a storage bag for blankets, children's toys or other things, perfect for college students, hiking, pet supplies, campers, apartments, hotel accommodations, baby rooms, and utility rooms. This waterproof laundry bag is also a collapsible travel laundry bag that you can easily fold and store in any drawer when you are not using it. 【Perfect Gift Choice】: We all have one dream - Making Life Easier! So our portable laundry bag is an upgraded version of the laundry basket, you can use it in any situation. There are two hanging loops on either side of the top to help open the opening, freeing your hands and making it easier to load clothes. So it's one of the best options for everyone's convenience on laundry days and a laundry hamper backpack is a new ideal gift for your family at Christmas, Thanksgiving, Birthdays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T4jPm2OLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fewelle","source_asin":"B0B59H5CNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B59H5CNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B59H5CNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579247,"name":"50 Minute Sand Timer - Yellow Sand in Natural Stand - 9.5\" Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I72H+Z-rL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 50 minute sand timer has yellow sand and a natural finish wood stand. Hourglasses were the first dependable, reusable and reasonably accurate measure of time. The rate of flow of the sand is independent of the depth in the upper reservoir, and the instrument will not freeze. Measurements: 9.5\" HHourglasses are said to have been invented at Alexandria about the middle of the third century, where they were sometimes carried around just as people carry watches today. It is speculated that it was in use in the 11th century, where it would have complemented the magnetic compass as an aid to navigation. Recorded evidence of their existence is found no earlier than the 14th century, the earliest being an hourglass appearing in the 1338 fresco Allegory of Good Government by Ambrogio Lorenzetti.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I72H+Z-rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pretty Clever Decor","source_asin":"B004V4M8HE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004V4M8HE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004V4M8HE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579248,"name":"Holiday Lights Single Electric Candolier with a Clear Bulb [40211]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fI3PdDJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The single eectric candolier with a clear flame bulb is 8.25 inches tall. The ivory colored base is made of poly resin and has the look of dripping wax around the top below the bulb. The electric candolier comes with a clear, C7½ bulb. The candolier has a 51 inch long cord. The cord uses a 5 Amp, 125 volt fuse, one is provided. This Christmas candleholders are for use with 120V, 60HZ AC only. When storing the candolier, carefully remove the product from wherever it is placed, to avoid any undue strain or stress on the product conductors, connections or wires. Store neatly in a cool dry location protected from sunlight and other elements. The UL approved flame light is cool burning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fI3PdDJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Lights","source_asin":"B00NUBIP3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NUBIP3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NUBIP3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
