window.products.push({"id":579399,"name":"Hand Poured 100% Pure Beeswax Votive Candles by Alternative Imagination (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TkcovefYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our beeswax votive candles are made with natural beeswax that has been filtered to remove impurities and debris, but still retains that beautiful light amber-yellow color and naturally sweet, honey-like aroma! Each batch comes from beeswax that is ethically and sustainably cultivated, giving you piece of mind as you enjoy your new candles. Beeswax burns cleanly, with little-to-no smoke or soot, and releases negative ions that draw out toxins, dust, pollen, mold, and mildew from the air. It will help rid the room of negative smells and bring positive energy. Add these votive candles to your bath routine, reading nook, or wherever else you need a light! This listing is for two (2) hand-poured votive candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TkcovefYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alternative Imagination","source_asin":"B079VMC5HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079VMC5HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079VMC5HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579400,"name":"Ceramic Tea Bowl Cup Footed Chawan Porcelain Teacup Metallic Glaze Chinese Teaware (blue, purple, copper, 1.7 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CYfStHrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This eye-catching porcelain tea bowl is created for savoring most delicious tea. It comes in different shapes so you may choose the one that suits your tastes or collect the set of cups for exquisite tea ceremony. Each vessel is fully covered with speckled glaze resembling oxidized metal. Chinese cups have no handles, they are designed to fit snugly into the palm of the hand. The steady foot allows you to place your bowl safely on the table.The tea cups were manufactured in Longquan, one of the largest historical ceramic producing areas in China. Tea is a wonderful beverage which is enjoyed all through the world and there are a lot of ceremonies in all parts of Asia for drinking and preparing the tea. This lovely tradition came to us from China where the tea was first used as a medicine. According to the legend, one of the rulers in the ancient China was looking for medical cures and got poisoned. And a drop of water from the tea tree saved him. Since then tea became popular as a recreational drink and nowadays there are countless traditions, ceremonies and events dedicated to this amazing drink. Our company “Pacific tea” is based in Hong Kong and strictly follows old traditions of tea culture. We have been wholesaling tea and teaware for about 130 years all over the world. Among our customers there are Chinese communities and restaurants, tea clubs and embassies. We are proud of the tea tradition in China, and we are dreaming of showing people the difference between ordinary tea drinking and savouring each drop of the precious liquor in the best Asian style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CYfStHrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Tea","source_asin":"B01M7XA87H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7XA87H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7XA87H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
