window.products.push({"id":579402,"name":"IGNIXIA Pack of 02 Trash Sign Decals self Adhesive - Recycling Stickers 5 x 5 Inches Recycle and Trash Sticker for Trash can - Recycle Labels (Black) ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711tf1jDkxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: Tired of sorting your trash signs for trash and recyclable items? Well, worry no more. Ignixia premium recycling and trash bin stickers are here to help you. FEATURES: SMOOTH INSTALLATION: Applying adhesive trash and recycling decals has never been easier. Just follow simple steps to install the trash bin sticker. Firstly, thoroughly clean the surface you want to apply on and then dry it. Hold the sticker in your hand, peel off the back, align the sticker and simply stick it. To ensure it is properly stuck, press on its sides with your hands. EASILY VISIBLE: Designed by experts with vibrant fonts and eye-catching graphics, these trash recycling stickers are visible and readable from far away. This ensures that the trash is efficiently sorted. HIGH QUALITY: IGNIXIA Recycle bin stickers are made of Industrial Grade Vinyl to endure harsh conditions indoor and outdoor. These are also Waterproof AND UV Resistant. Specifications : Color: Black (The Industry Standard Colors) Size: 10” x 7” inches Recycle can sticker Package Includes: 02 Trash signs Material: PVC Vinyl Decal Shape: Square with curved edges","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711tf1jDkxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IGNIXIA","source_asin":"B091Q57BDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Q57BDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Q57BDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579403,"name":"KingBra 4Pcs Replacement HEPA Filters Vacuum Cleaner Parts Compatible with Neato Botvac D & Connected Series D7 D80 D85 D3 D75 D5 70e 75 80 85","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614nJpQwUxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification: Compatible Model: Vacuum Cleaner Filter Compatible with Neato Botvac & D Series models 70e 75 80 85 D75 D80 D85 D3 D5. The HEPA filter can be used with sweeper robots to clean particles and fine dust from carpets, including cat and dog dander, dust, pollen and fiber, protecting you and your family at all times. Note: If used daily, the life of the filter is 4 months and needs to be replaced, otherwise it will affect the life of the machine. Our research found that many machines are damaged without replacing the filter, so it's best to replace your spare parts every 1 to 2 months to keep your home robot operating at peak performance. Package includes: 4 x Replacement Vacuum Filter Note: This is not a Neato Botvac OEM product. The Neato Botvac brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Neato Botvac brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614nJpQwUxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KingBra","source_asin":"B07FD21DK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FD21DK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FD21DK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579404,"name":"Native Spring Ceramic Coffee Pour Over Dripper Single Serve Brewer Pack Includes 40 Filters Size no. 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6157CMvLpPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Most of the coffee lovers nowadays are embracing the capacity to make a single serve cup of their most-loved type of coffee. With the help of Native Spring Ceramic Coffee Dripper you can savour the sweet fragrance of your cup of coffee every day. Simply place the dripper over your mug, set the paper filter, add your ground coffee and boiling water (slowly and with a circular motion over the grounds) and in a few minutes you'll enjoy your delicious and flavorful coffee. Our dripper has three small holes on the bottom of the drip coffee cone encouraging a slower drain which maximizes rich delectable flavors. The single cup coffee maker has noticeable vertical wave ridges keeping the filter from adhering to the walls of the cone, allowing a full flavor extraction every time you brew your coffee. Its durable, ceramic body allows you to create perfect pour-over style coffee brewing every time. You can use your coffee dripper not only in your very own kitchen but it's also great for camping, hiking or even when you are in a hotel. There are 40 #2 coffee filters included. This is an excellent ready-to-use gift for your friends and family who are coffee enthusiasts. Get the best quality coffee dripper delivered to your door by clicking on the \"Add to cart\" button now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6157CMvLpPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Native Spring","source_asin":"B01D0RPMUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D0RPMUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D0RPMUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
