window.products.push({"id":579500,"name":"Handmade Wooden Trivet for Hot Dishes - 7.5 Inch. - Big Coaster - 6 Sorts of Wood - Natural Smell - Unique Art Decor in the Kitchen - Made by SPL Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F2YW6WhCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE HANDCRAFTED WOOD STAND – JUNIPER is known for pleasant long lasting aroma, good physical properties and the resulting dense decorative wood that is resistant to staining. Juniper's smell is an excellent tool for stress relief. Unique properties of PLUM WOOD allow it to be used in the creation of \"ebony\", inlays, musical instruments and other decorative products. ACACIA does not crack or warp, has great resistance to friction and perfectly polished. A characteristic feature of BIRD CHERRY WOOD is the smell of almond. This kind of wood can withstand to biological influences and decay. Undoubtedly, the most famous and significant tree in the world is the OAK that collected many myths and legends. Oak wood is distinguished by its strength, density, hardness and weight. Such characteristic of HAZEL WOOD, as compliance in polishing and dressing with various compositions, allows it to be used in the manufacture of decorative details.UKRAINIAN ETHNO DESIGN - Inspired from handcraft traditions of Ukraine, the design is traditional and ethnic.NATURAL, ECO FRIENDLY AND SAFE TO USE - Does not include any dangerous, lacquer or harmful substances. Heat resistant, does not get hot or exude toxic fumes or melt like plastic.MAINTENANCE - Lasts a long time if taken care of. Protect from direct sunlight. Avoid storing in extremely dry or humid conditions. Wash by hand and dry with towel. Do not dishwash, soak or dry in oven. Can be sanded slightly to remove marks of over-usage.NOTICE! - Each piece is unique and may vary slightly in exact shape, size, wood texture and color. May include small knots, cleavages or traces of bark.RISK-FREE - You are fully protected by Amazon terms and conditions and can return the product for 30 days. SPL woodcraft promises to resolve any later complaints for products purchased from our Amazon webstore.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F2YW6WhCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPL woodcraft","source_asin":"B06XDR73N1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XDR73N1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XDR73N1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
