window.products.push({"id":579565,"name":"Santa on Poet Walk in Central Park, New York City 14x11 Inch Matted Ready to Frame Art High End Custom Giclee Photo Print Picture Size 10 1/2 x 7 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r69OFb8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas time in New York City is about much more than just the exchange of special gifts and Season’s Greetings. To put it simply, Christmas time in New York is synonymous with a special kind of modern-day romanticism and nostalgia. Therefore come the festive season, millions of people find themselves captivated by the fairytale-like marvel of traditional Rockefeller Center Christmas tree decorations, Winter wonderland in Central Park, exquisite Windows decorations of Fifth Ave stores, not to mention the timeless snow blanketed panorama of the Brooklyn Bridge. Thankfully, no matter where you might be in the world this Christmas, you too can now celebrate the majesty of Christmas time in the Big Apple, thanks to the NY Christmas Gifts Christmas Art Collection. Add our New York City Art Prints to your Holidays Decoration ideas. Any picture from our collection will be appropriate to display on home or office wall to add elegant touch to your holiday decoration ideas. With each Artwork in the “Christmas in New York” collection adorned with captivating photography by Igor and Lilia Maloratsky, you will be able to gift remarkable and ultimately beautiful Merry Christmas and Season’s art prints to your friends and loved ones. This being the case, our Art Photo Prints embody subtle refinement and elegance, making them perfect for a wide variety of personal and business gifts ideas. Made with special attention to details, the NY Christmas Gifts “Christmas in New York” art collection celebrates visual spectacles such as Grand Central Station in wintertime, as well as a variety of touching Central Park vistas. Our Art prints are therefore perfect for gifting to anyone with absolutely any kind of personal and/or cultural ties to the Big Apple. Our Art Prints Collection Made with care in United States. See the difference quality makes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r69OFb8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NY Poster Inc","source_asin":"B00H8B67HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H8B67HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H8B67HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
