window.products.push({"id":579570,"name":"Wheat Straw Cups Set of 4 - 12oz Drinking Cups for Kids & Adults - Natural Wheatstraw Plastic Cups Reusable Dishwasher Safe - BPA Free Unbreakable Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819tf37xHML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 Wheat Straw Cups -- Our natural wheat fiber plastic drinking glasses cup sets for kitchen look just as elegant stacked neatly inside the cabinet as they do laid out in an attractive tabletop setting or in the hands of family members and visitors to your home. Upscale, stylish, and modern with a smooth-matte texture that is comfortable to grip. Family Friendly Plastic Alternative -- These wheat straw/plastic glasses are reusable plastic cups that are extremely sturdy yet lightweight, safe for toddlers and small children. A non-slip drinking glasses set that will keep cold drinks cold for longer, with no condensation on the exterior or wet rings left on the table if someone forgets a coaster. Shatterproof & Perfectly Stackable -- These nearly unbreakable glasses for drinking are shatterproof, splinter-free, and resistant to chipping at the rim and any wear-related damage. Anti-drop design. Perfect as kids cups for a kitchen with tile floors (the cups bounce right off!) Great when grandkids visit and want to eat outside, on the patio, or by the pool. Putting People and Planet First -- Dishwasher safe! Replace breakable glasses with an easy to clean, nature-based alternative that looks great and holds up even better. At Greendish we help you make more environmentally guided choices so you can reduce your consumption of plastic, while encouraging greater reliance on eco-friendly solutions and natural materials. Environmental Charity & Lifetime Warranty -- By partnering with One Tree Planted, a non-profit organization focused on global reforestation, we make it simple to help save the environment. That's why every order you place with us equals a new tree planted in your name. Together we can restore forests, create habitats for biodiversity, and make a positive social impact around the world. Your purchase isn't just green, it's guaranteed: all Green Dish products come with a Lifetime Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819tf37xHML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREENDISH","source_asin":"B0BKHBLHTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKHBLHTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKHBLHTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
