window.products.push({"id":579645,"name":"15 Feet-MRbrew Brewing Gas Tubing, Homebrew PVC Plastic Kegerator Keg Draft Beer Co2 Dispensing Line Set Red Hose Kegging Kit with Hose Clamps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ep71M1qxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Long 15 Feet Tubing for Multiple Keg Dispensing: compared to other brewing hose kits, MRbrew co2 gas dispensing hose features a great length of 15 feet, you can apply this hose to your sankey keg tap system and cornelius ball lock kegging system simultaneously by cutting this 15 feet hose, this pretty long homebrew gas line can be cut into multiple sections to meet your mutiple kegging needs perfectly. Can be Easily Cut by Cutting Tool: the short length brewing hose kit can not be cut and it can not be applied to your multiple keg dispensing process simultaneously, or the fixed hose fitting kit comes with extra fittings and you need to spend extra money, this 15 feet gas line can be cut into any length to meet your needs, you can can equip it with your own brewing dispensing parts, brings great convenience and creative possibilities for your multi-kegging brewing dispensing system. Powerful No Leaking Pressure Transferring Tubing: the inside diameter of this great long kegging dispensing hose is 7mm, thick enough hose wall prevents the gas tubing kinks and maintains hose shape stability, smoothly transmit gas without leakage with the help of hose clamps. you can attach this kegerator hose to the beer barb fitting connector that has an outside diameter of 5/16'' to transfer your brewing gas to your beer keg. Great Versatility and Widely Used: MRbrew 15 feet gas hose can withstand the co2 gas pressure value that can be up to 70 psi, you can attach this hose to ball lock quick disconnect fittings to transfer brewing gas co2 for carbonating beer, kombucha and other beverage at outdoor picnic, party, etc, you also can use this hose at garden activities. Reliable Durable PVC Plastic: this 15 feet keg draft co2 gas line is made of healthy plastic, will not rot, swell, dry out, no ordors and unaffected by normal cleaning compounds, strong oil resistance, smooth surface makes cleaning easy, keeps pure beverage carbonation gas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ep71M1qxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MRbrew","source_asin":"B09HC3T66S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HC3T66S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HC3T66S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
