window.products.push({"id":579677,"name":"OCTROT Electric Heated Blanket Throw, 10 Heating Level Blanket & 5 Options Auto Off & 5 min Fast Heating Blanket, Sherpa Heated Blanket Soft Lap Warmi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q0t4NjvOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[KEEP YOU WARM] Octrot electric blanket is what you want if you constantly get cold and you are afraid of that feeling. 10 heat settings provides you quite a range from a warm to a pretty hot. 5 timer options to automatically turn off make this even more intriguing: 1/2/4/6/8h. By advanced flexible wiring, the heated throw warms fast: 5 min fast heating, the sooner the better. [BUFFALO PLAID IS COMING] The heated throw is soft like babt rabbits. One side, it is soft sherpa blanket, on the other side, it's the silky flannel heated blanket. What a lovely company when you are binge-watching on the couch. Plus nobody doesn't like buffalo plaid: this spanned-decades pattern makes for great christmas decor. [SIMPLE TO USE] There is one vital rule when you use the warming heated throw blanket: do not plug the main power cord into the wall before you connect the cord to the module. 🎯 Always plug the cord into the module first 🎯 The opposite, to disconnect the controller: ⛳firstly unplug the power cord from the wall outlet⛳. 5-year-warranty is for sure, we provide you 24-hour response guarantee: feel free to contact us! [PRESS BUTTONS NECESSARY HOW ] People hate it when the blanket slip off your back again and again. These three little elves keep it up all around and allow you to wear a warm blanket like a wearable poncho. Unplug it then you get a trendy poncho. 💗 Also, you could really use a soft heated throw to keep you from freezing at work. Who would not want to firmly wear a heated blanket while she or he has ton of work to do and has no time to pick up the dropping one. [LARGER HEATING LESS BILLS] Built-in continuous sensing technology to maintain the temperature at the heating level you have set before, which actually 💰 add up to big savings on electric bills 💰 but offer 31% larger heating area than those ordinary blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q0t4NjvOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCTROT","source_asin":"B09JC6S7FL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JC6S7FL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JC6S7FL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
