window.products.push({"id":579819,"name":"Pro 6 In 1 Food Vacuum Sealer Machine-Versatile Food Sealer with Bags and Rolls-Wet Food Mode,85Kpa Great Suction,Consecutive Sealing,Sous Vide Applie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i6bmrhncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MARINADE FRIENDLY】Moist-function to activate a low pressure suction and reliable double seal, enabling you to seal even the juiciest of foods with no compromise 【STRONG SUCTION POWER SAVE YOUR TIME】 With powerful dual pumps air sealing technology, Verivac food sealer machine can easily complete the vacuum and sealing within 10-20 seconds. And advanced temperature control system help to consecutive vacuum sealing. 【VERSATILE VACUUM SEALING MODE】 Our food vacuum sealer machine is designed with DRY/MOIST/FAST/SLOW 4 selectable combination modes which are suit for majority of food. What’s more, VAC SEAL/SEAL ONLY/ VACUUM ONLY modes makes it easy to operate automatically in different scenarios. 【SCREEN TOUCH & INDICATOR LIGHTS】 This automatic kitchen vacuum sealer machine built-in sensitive screen panel with soft-touch digital control buttons, three-color LED indicator lights easily guide you through the vacuum sealing process. 【WHAT YOU GET】 VERIFOST Vacuum sealer set include vacuum sealer machine, one roll bags, 10 pieces bags (7.8x8.7 in), patented cutter, hose, wine stopper and user manual. 【KEEP FOOD FRESH LONGER】 This Verivac Vacuum Sealer Machine keeps food fresh up to 5 times in the freezer compared to ordinary storage. Vacuum sealing also help prevent freezer burn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i6bmrhncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VERIFOST","source_asin":"B09H5KTT86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5KTT86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5KTT86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":579820,"name":"Sipping Stones Whiskey Rocks - Set of 9 White Whisky Chilling Stones - 100% Pure Soapstone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41P0E2yRxhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sipping Stones is the aficionado's choice for chilling a drink. It eliminates a common problem for all connoisseurs of fine distilled spirits: it cools your drink perfectly without the dilution from melting ice. Now all your favorite drinks are able to be served the way they were intended to be, perfectly pure and precisely chilled. Sipping Stones are non-porous meaning there is no odor or taste to tarnish your drink. And unlike ice, Sipping Stones provides a smooth chill that does not overwhelm the character of your beverage. Each set of Sipping Stones comes with nine finely crafted cubes made from soapstone, a safe alternative to ice. Sipping Stones is a great gift for anyone who loves the perfectly chilled beverage. Or you can use it as a conversation starter at your next party. Simply keep the Sipping Stones in your freezer until you are ready to chill your favorite drink, alcoholic or otherwise.  Use: Rinse before first usage then place in your freezer until the stones are as cold as desired. When ready, add two or three stones to your glass. Fill the glass with enough liquid to cover the stones. Let the drink sit for a few minutes to allow the stones to chill your drink. After use, simply rinse and allow the stones to dry before returning them to your freezer. Never chew or attempt to eat.  About Soapstone: Known for its ability to maintain a temperature for long periods of time, natural soapstone is listed as Generally Regarded As Safe (GRAS) by the FDA. Soapstone is made up of talc which will not react to water, alcohol and or other drinks. If used with care, soapstone will not scratch your glasses. Like Sipping Stones on Facebook for a chance to win a free Sipping Stones gift set!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41P0E2yRxhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sipping Stones","source_asin":"B005FMUEKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-579820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005FMUEKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005FMUEKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
